From 7a292d48f3c77112ab7028b8268a875082a26746 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:13:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Move version catalog to JSON and extend rule format

- Load known version profiles from versions/index.json instead of code,
  and add a loader field to VersionProfile.
- Add optional loader, type and message fields to rules; rules are now
  routed and applied per loader.
- Add warn rules that report matches in the migration report without
  changing files.
- Add RuleFormatTest and document the new fields in the README.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017cjHkPet6EQbigJBGtkEKc
